USA Today 's Robert Bianco awarded the film three stars out of four , saying High School Musical 2 was `` sweet , smart , bursting with talent and energy , and awash in innocence '' . While critics enjoyed the film , they noted that the timing of the movie 's premiere seemed odd , premiering just when school was about to start up again , while the movie 's plot involved the gang going on summer vacation . High School Musical 2 won the `` So Hot Right Now '' award at the Nickelodeon Australian Kids ' Choice Awards 2007 , in which High School Musical castmate Zac Efron hosted with The Veronicas . High School Musical 2 : on stage ! Main article : High School Musical 2 : On Stage ! Pacific Repertory Theatre 's School of Dramatic Arts High School Musical Act 1 Finale . Like the original High School Musical , the sequel has been adapted into two different theatrical productions : a one - act , 70 - minute version and a two - act full - length production .","entities":["High School Musical 2","Robert Bianco","USA Today","So Hot Right Now","Nickelodeon Australian Kids' Choice Awards 2007","The Veronicas","High School Musical 2: On Stage!","School of Dramatic Arts","High School Musical Act 1 Finale","Pacific Repertory Theatre","Zac Efron","High School Musical"],"facts":["David Nessim Lawrence -CREATED-> High School Musical 2","Salty Pictures -CREATED-> High School Musical 2","First Street Films -CREATED-> High School Musical 2","Kenny Ortega -CREATED-> High School Musical 2","Peter Barsocchini -CREATED-> High School Musical 2"]}
