During filming , stunt woman Joi `` SJ '' Harris died in a motorcycle accident . Deadpool 2 is scheduled to be released in the United States on May 18 , 2018 . A sequel , Deadpool 3 , is in development . Contents ( hide ) 1 Premise 2 Cast 3 Production 3.1 Development 3.2 Pre-production 3.3 Filming 3.4 Post-production 4 Music 5 Release 5.1 Marketing 6 Box office projection 7 Sequel 8 References 9 External links Premise Deadpool forms a team of mutants called the X-Force to protect young mutant Russell from the time - traveling soldier Cable . Cast Ryan Reynolds as Wade Wilson / Deadpool : A wisecracking mercenary with accelerated healing but severe scarring over his body after undergoing an experimental regenerative mutation . He forms the X-Force , a team of mutants . Josh Brolin as Nathan Summers / Cable : A time travelling cybernetic mutant soldier , `` in many ways the opposite of Deadpool '' .","entities":["United States","Joi Harris","Wade Wilson","Nathan Summers","Russell","Ryan Reynolds","Josh Brolin","Motorcycle accident","X-Force","Deadpool 2 release","Deadpool 3","Deadpool 2"],"facts":["Julian Dennison -RELATED_TO-> Russell","Ryan Reynolds -RELATED_TO-> 2016 CinemaCon","Initial box office projections for Deadpool 2 -RELATED_TO-> United States","Russell -RELATED_TO-> Cable","Ryan Reynolds -RELATED_TO-> Ryan Reynolds on Deadpool 2 and new director David Leitch"]}
